{"parentUuid":"49e5c7ed-28cb-499f-8f6a-afd3a46b4452","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b902815f-d574-463b-b5b3-ccf70775c7e4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Elia Ben Cnaan wants a combined monitoring site under ONE link with a toggle to switch between two boards:\n   - **Guide board (בורד המדריך)** — the existing analytics board at `https://nanoshellano.vercel.app/leads-dash-9f3k2a.html` (visitors, leads, funnel). Do NOT touch its structure; just make it \"updated and connected\" and accessible via the toggle. Elia insisted he'd already been sent this board earlier (\"יש לך אותו... את שלחת לי אותו מקודם\") — I confirmed it = leads-dash-9f3k2a.html.\n   - **App board (בורד האפליקציה)** — NEW, Daniela develops it. Initially scoped as \"entries by source link\" but Elia EXPANDED it (message 25110): it must monitor the whole INTERFACE JOURNEY — everyone who enters the link, which screens/pages they viewed, whether they clicked, how far they progressed in the flow, and whether they left details or dropped without leaving details (\"כל הרעיון זה לעשות מוניטורינג על הממשק לא רק על אלו שהשאירו פרטים\"). Those who leave details = one slice; the anonymous-journey monitoring = the interesting part.\n   - Both boards in the SAME link/resource, with a switch (מדריך ↔ אפליקציה). They may look different. Guide board structure untouched; only the app board is developed by Daniela.\n   - Data must refresh ONLY on manual click, NOT automatically (to save resources).\n   - Build the app board on the premise that MORE source links will be created and shared in the future (extensible with zero code change). For now only two links exist: the WhatsApp share for shellano (bare domain) and for click2agent (bare domain).\n   - Elia offered to hand this to Claude Code (message 25112); Daniela declined — it's entirely the Vercel/frontend side, fully autonomous, no VM/Claude Code dependency.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Two-board-one-link combined monitoring site with a JS view toggle.\n   - Vercel projects (org `team_F0AxgY5NNvhzdlPBtvW1WxFA`, scope `elia-8583s-projects`):\n     - `nanohub_demo` (prj_gfu3pMAdkWONifM3Z28oS0zkUIue) → nanohubdemo.vercel.app — serves board.html, api/register.js, api/app-entries.js, nano.html, app.html, ops.html. Daniela fully controls it.\n     - `nanoclaw_guide` (prj_YIDCAdz9lQy1CPIBy8O6qDcQPiGK) → nanoshellano.vercel.app — the guide site + analytics engine (api/t.js, api/summary.js, api/leads.js, leads-dash-9f3k2a.html). Store = Vercel Blob. Source NOT fully in workspace (only api files downloaded).\n     - `nanoshellano-site` (prj_FDe5kTfa7y72wQtoAcS8WuINjFDh) → shellano.com + click2agent.com. Canonical live landing source = `tmp_shellano_hotfix/index.html` → `node gen_shellano.mjs` → deploy from tmp_shellano_hotfix.\n   - Guide analytics engine: `/api/t` ingest endpoint (sendBeacon/fetch, text/plain JSON); writes one Vercel Blob per event under prefix `ev/` (visit/session) or `lead/`; `/api/summary` reads all blobs and aggregates; store token = `BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN` (value starts `vercel_blob_rw_gzvo64s...`).\n   - Tracker payload shapes: visit = {vid,page,role,lang,referrer,utm_source,utm_medium,utm_campaign,ua}; session = {type:'session',vid,page,...,dwell_ms,max_scroll,max_step,events:[{e,t,ms}]}.\n   - App landing (`tmp_shellano_hotfix/index.html`): N=5 slides (0 hero, 1 demo, 2 list, 3 pilot, 4 form); `goTo(i)`→`render()`; `current` index; CTA action next/submit/telegram; `submitForm()` posts to nanohubdemo.vercel.app/api/register with `src: computeSrc()`. `computeSrc()` already present.\n   - Source attribution: register.js already accepts body.src (line 31 `const src = String(body.src||\"\").trim().slice(0,64);`); admin server exposes `/admin/agents?key=...` JSON with sourceBreakdown + per-age